      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s013-u005",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பையன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s013-d005",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 21,
            "printedPage": 13
          }
        ],
        "text": "The cover, sir.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s013-u006",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s013-d006",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 21,
            "printedPage": 13
          }
        ],
        "text": "Tch! Is only the cover good? The printing too is gem-like.",
        "notes": [
          "`அட்டை மாத்திரந்தான் நல்லா இருக்கா?` is a retort asking whether only the cover is good; it is not a suggestion to change the cover.",
          "The source phrase `மணி மணியா` is retained as the image `gem-like` rather than normalized into a modern printing-quality term."
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s013-u007",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "பரந்தாமன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s013-d007",
        "sourceOccurrenceId": null,
        "pageProvenance": [
          {
            "pdfPage": 21,
            "printedPage": 13
          }
        ],
        "text": "Garuda! I did not ask for criticism of how the printing is or how the cover is; I am asking how the advice I have given is.",
        "notes": []
      },
      {
        "id": "tirumbippaar-en-s013-u008",
        "kind": "dialogue",
        "speakerLabel": "கருடன்",
        "sourceRecordId": "tirumbippaar-s013-d008",
